## 🧾 Analyst Notes (How this maps to real SOC work)

- **Status hygiene** (*In Progress* → *Closed*) prevents duplicate investigations and establishes accountability. [page:1][file:47]
- **Prioritization discipline** (severity + age) is essential when queues are large and time-to-detect matters. [page:1][file:43]
- **Verdict quality** depends on evidence: alert fields, surrounding events, and validating assumptions (not intuition). [page:1]
- **Escalation readiness**: L1 is expected to escalate when confidence indicates real threat or when deeper remediation is needed. [page:1][file:47]

